microcontroller_examples = softwareSystem "Microcontroller Examples" "Public Arduino example sketches for the Offbeat integrations - Spotify and Fitbit API calls over JSON and CBOR, and Alexa and Google Home device-side commands - plus the small provider-specific helper headers those sketches share. The sketches are opened directly in the Arduino IDE and are the tagged source for the code snippets shown in the Offbeat UI documentation." {
  tags "firmware"
